WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.542
Here is the complete local inference path in one compact example.

00:00:05.542 --> 00:00:13.347
We begin with role-based messages, apply the model's chat template, tokenize the formatted text,

00:00:13.347 --> 00:00:17.867
move the tensors to the model device, and call generate.

00:00:17.867 --> 00:00:27.377
After generation, we separate the newly generated token I D's from the original prompt and decode only those new tokens.

00:00:27.377 --> 00:00:33.103
That final decode gives us the assistant response without repeating the entire input.
